  {
   "address": 32808,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The entry byte both vectors name, and a flag. title_clear sets it to 0 and title_raster sets bit 7 again once tune2 has passed its fifth marker, after which RETURN is accepted. Run as code, $80 is an undocumented two-byte NOP that swallows the SEI after it; its value as the file arrives was not observed."
  },
  {
   "address": 32809,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Starts the title: the stack reset, a black border, the bitmap off, the raster call to title_raster ($8238), and the VIC-II set from the list after the call."
  },
  {
   "address": 32834,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "vic_inline_writes's list, register and value: $D015=$00, $D01B=$00, $D01D=$00, $D017=$00, $D011=$3B, $D012=$FA, $D016=$08, $D018=$79, $D019=$FF, $D01A=$81, $D020=$00; $FF ends it."
  },
  {
   "address": 32857,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "VIC-II bank 1, sprites off, text at the screen $5C00 and bitmap $6000, the screen and bitmap cleared (title_clear); then the stage set to 0 and the marines byte to $FF (all eight alive), and tune2 started."
  },
  {
   "address": 32901,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each pass: tune2's marker count $057B picks the logo step (logo_steps) and the credit (credit_steps). RETURN (title_raster sets $0605 bit 7) ends the stage with stage_complete; the end of the cycle ($0609) clears the screen and starts tune2 again."
  },
  {
   "address": 32935,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A new credit: its bitmap rows cleared (credit_clear_bitmap), its colours black (credit_colours with 0), the credit unpacked from credit_unpackers, and its colours orange ($80)."
  },
  {
   "address": 32973,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The credit routine's address, low byte (written here)."
  },
  {
   "address": 32974,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The credit routine's high byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 32980,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A new logo step: its two handlers from logo_once and logo_each written into the JSRs at $80F9 and $80FC, and the first run once."
  },
  {
   "address": 33018,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "logo_once's handler, low byte (written here)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33019,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The once-only handler's high byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 33020,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The step's handler for every pass."
  },
  {
   "address": 33021,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "logo_each's handler, low byte (written here)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33022,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The every-pass handler's high byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 33026,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The handler each logo step runs once, by step 0 to 7: nothing, logo frame 1, the colour band ($8194), nothing, nothing, frame 4, the band white ($81AF), nothing."
  },
  {
   "address": 33027,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "logo_once read from its second byte: each handler's high byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 33042,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The handler each step runs every pass: nothing, logo_rows, flicker between frames 1 and 2, between 2 and 3, between 3 and 4, the colours between blue and white, nothing, and title_end_wait."
  },
  {
   "address": 33043,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "logo_each from its second byte: the high bytes."
  },
  {
   "address": 33058,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Logo step 0's handlers: an RTS each."
  },
  {
   "address": 33059,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 0's every-pass handler: an RTS."
  },
  {
   "address": 33060,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Unpacks logo frame 1."
  },
  {
   "address": 33064,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Runs logo_rows."
  },
  {
   "address": 33068,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 2's first pass: the logo's band blue (logo_band_blue)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33072,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At random, logo frame 1 or frame 2: the random byte $0600 is rotated left and its old top bit picks the frame."
  },
  {
   "address": 33081,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The trainer pokes $8139 when it loads level 6; here it is the BCS's offset."
  },
  {
   "address": 33082,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside the JSR: the trainer pokes $813A when it loads level 6, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33083,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The trainer pokes $813B too, for level 6."
  },
  {
   "address": 33090,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 3's first pass: an RTS."
  },
  {
   "address": 33091,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At random, logo frame 2 or 3."
  },
  {
   "address": 33109,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 4's first pass: an RTS."
  },
  {
   "address": 33110,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At random, logo frame 3 or 4."
  },
  {
   "address": 33128,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 5's first pass: logo frame 4."
  },
  {
   "address": 33132,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At random, the logo band blue or white, each pass."
  },
  {
   "address": 33144,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside the JSR: the trainer pokes $8178 when it loads level 4, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33150,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 6's first pass: the band white."
  },
  {
   "address": 33154,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 6's every pass and step 7's first: an RTS each."
  },
  {
   "address": 33155,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 7's first pass: an RTS."
  },
  {
   "address": 33156,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Step 7: waits 255 frames and then 128 more, holding the finished logo, and asks for the cycle to start again ($0609 = $80)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33172,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Fills the logo's band of the screen ($5CF0-$5E07) with $60, blue pixels on black."
  },
  {
   "address": 33174,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Fills the band with A (by fill_memory, Y the byte)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33199,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The band with $E0, light blue."
  },
  {
   "address": 33204,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The band with 0, black: the logo hidden."
  },
  {
   "address": 33209,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The logo appearing: every 128 frames one more row of the band shows, from the bottom ($0602 counts 7 down), and each pass the rows shown flicker at random between blue and black."
  },
  {
   "address": 33335,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Back to the loop."
  },
  {
   "address": 33336,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The raster call: level_frame, a random byte to $0600, sprite 0 (the gleam in the logo's I, frame 0 at x $99, y $78, white) on at random during step 7, RETURN accepted once return_armed is set."
  },
  {
   "address": 33373,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Arms RETURN once $057B reaches 5, so the first pass of the cycle cannot be skipped in its first seconds."
  },
  {
   "address": 33390,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "RETURN ($0221 = $0D) asks title_loop to end the stage ($0605 = $80)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33402,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The gleam's place and colour; sprite pointer 0 is frame 0."
  },
  {
   "address": 33429,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The credit shown at each of tune2's 30 markers, then six zeros: 0 leaves the screen as it is; 1 to 7 pick from credit_unpackers."
  },
  {
   "address": 33465,
